{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：23:16 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>姚焯菲（Chantel）上週公佈將於12月26日晚上8時正，在澳門銀河G Box舉行《姚焯菲 Chantel 想飛 Live Concert 2026澳門站》，適逢演出當天為Boxing Day，大家可以和Chantel一起過聖誕，因此消息一傳出，瞬即成為熱門話題。是次演唱會票價分別為$1080（VIP）和$680兩種，VIP門票包括1對1合照，門票將在明天（27日）起於銀河票務及大麥公開發售。</p>\n<h2>姚焯菲陪「小菲象」拆禮物</h2>\n<p>Chantel表示為了和早前的演出有所不同，今次歌單也會重新設計，加添了一些之前香港站沒有唱過的曲目。Chantel更趁著課餘時間專誠去購買聖誕禮物，留待個唱澳門站當晚送給幸運觀眾，她說她花了不少心思揀選這些禮物，希望大家會喜歡，也期望和大家在銀河G Box渡過一個難忘的Boxing Day。</p>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲上周公布，\\於12月26日晚上8時正，在澳門銀河G Box舉行《姚焯菲 Chantel 想飛 Live Concert 2026澳門站》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56bdef1bc6416aeef68acdadb30d94de/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_28_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲趁課餘時間採購聖誕禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8952f86cc8220e7363ff8423c3bb44f5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_28_24_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《姚焯菲 Chantel 想飛 Live Concert 2026澳門站》\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/713cd2e273983a719e17fdf211f24fac/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_28_24_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲為Boxing Day澳門騷增添驚喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbb4894e69d12122dd7de7a1b48033e0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_28_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《姚焯菲 Chantel 想飛 Live Concert 2026澳門站》\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7680f52678b3958904fd4f78e3950962/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_28_25.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:40:46.402707+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":386,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:18:57.305032+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:26.677374+00:00","content_hash":"dbbd7cebc3300e85bd502bf84042268c25677284e7392639201f471f076a9809","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}